{"id":"anschuldigung","lemma":"Anschuldigung","pos":"noun","rank":4291,"glosses":["accusation"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7f/De-Anschuldigung.ogg/De-Anschuldigung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Anschuldigung","plural":"Anschuldigungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich habe von den Anschuldigungen gehört.","en":"I heard about the accusations.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"}]},{"text":"Das ist eine schwere Anschuldigung.","en":"That's a very serious accusation to make.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"heavy, weighty","l":"schwer"},null]},{"text":"Diese Anschuldigungen sind lächerlich.","en":"These allegations are ridiculous.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"ridiculous"}]},{"text":"Er wies die Anschuldigung von sich.","en":"He denied the accusation.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/40654","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to indicate","l":"weisen"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"oneself"}]},{"text":"Sie ist nicht hier, um sich gegen diese Anschuldigungen zu verteidigen.","en":"She's not here to defend herself against these accusations.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44846","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"against"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to defend"}]}]}